yons. She lost half of them, so she bought a new set of 20 crayons. How many crayons in total does Martha have after the purchase?", "answer": "In the beginning, Martha lost 18 / 2 = <<18/2=9>>9 crayons.\nSo after she bought a set of new crayons, she has in total 9 + 20 = <<9+20=29>>29 crayons.\n#### 29", "prompt": "Solve the following grade-school math problem. Show your reasoning and put the final answer in \\boxed{}.\n\nProblem: Martha has 18 crayons. She lost half of them, so she bought a new set of 20 crayons. How many crayons in total does Martha have after the purchase?\nSolution:", "solutions": ["29"], "solution": "29"}, "prompt_tokens": [151644, 872, 198, 50, 3948, 279, 2701, 11972, 34689, 6888, 3491, 13, 6928, 697, 32711, 323, 2182, 279, 1590, 4226, 304, 1124, 79075, 6257, 382, 31198, 25, 50870, 702, 220, 16, 23, 88916, 2382, 13, 2932, 5558, 4279, 315, 1105, 11, 773, 1340, 10788, 264, 501, 738, 315, 220, 17, 15, 88916, 2382, 13, 2585, 1657, 88916, 2382, 304, 2790, 1558, 50870, 614, 1283], "response_tokens": [151667, 198, 32313, 11, 1077, 594, 1490, 13, 50870, 702, 220, 16, 23, 88916, 2382, 15102, 13, 5005, 1340, 32191, 4279, 315, 1105, 13, 2055, 1156, 11, 358, 1184, 311, 7071, 700, 1246, 1657, 88916, 2382, 1340, 5558, 13, 25839, 315, 220, 16, 23, 1112, 88190, 11, 220, 16, 23, 17779, 553, 220, 17, 374, 220, 24, 13, 2055, 1340, 5558, 220, 24, 88916]}
